  "label": "Racist Stereotype: White Sacrifice for Black Freedom",
  "description": "A racist trope that falsely claims that white people sacrificed their lives for the benefit of Black people, often used to justify or minimize contemporary racial inequalities. This stereotype is used in the meme to imply that the historical sacrifice of white lives was made for the benefit of Black people, which is a distortion of history and promotes racial division. The meme uses the image of diverse women to visually contrast with the racially charged text, potentially implying that the historical sacrifice was made for the benefit of Black people, which is a distortion of history.",
